      "Box Jump": "Stand before a sturdy box, drop into a quarter squat and explode up, land softly on both feet with knees slightly bent.",
      "Bulgarian Split Squat": "Rear foot elevated on a bench, front foot forward, lower until back knee nearly touches the ground.",
      "DB Romanian Deadlift": "Hinge at the hips with slight knee bend, lower dumbbells along the shins until hamstring stretch, drive hips through to stand.",
      "DB Row (single-arm)": "Brace on a bench, pull the dumbbell toward the hip keeping the elbow close to the body.",
      "Goblet Squat": "Hold a dumbbell at chest height, squat down keeping chest tall and elbows inside the knees.",
      "Lateral Bound": "Jump sideways off one leg, land softly on the opposite leg, stick the landing.",
      "Mountain Climbers": "In a push-up position, drive knees toward chest alternating quickly, keep hips level.",
      "Nordic Hamstring Curl": "Kneel with ankles anchored, slowly lower body resisting with hamstrings, catch with hands and push back up.",
      "Push-Up (weighted optional)": "Standard push-up with a weight plate on the back when bodyweight feels easy.",
      "Reverse Lunge": "Step one foot back, lower until both knees near 90 degrees, front knee over ankle.",
      "Side Plank with Hip Dip": "In a side plank, lower the hip toward the ground then raise it back up.",
      "Single-Leg RDL": "Balance on one leg, hinge forward reaching toward the ground while the free leg extends behind, keep back flat.",
      "Skater Jump": "Jump laterally from one foot to the other, reach opposite hand toward landing foot, stay low.",
      "Squat Jump": "Squat to parallel then explode up as high as possible, land softly and reset.",
      "Tricep Dip": "Hands on edge of a bench behind you, lower by bending elbows to 90 degrees then push back up.",
